_:ndc0f779e3f264ad4b3096e3ebc7e496ab1 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#description> "\r\n        property onFields specifies the fields in LogicalView that are involved by the structural annotation. The semantics of this involvement depends on the specific annotation.\r\n        " .
_:nac1e0b050e484fb191d8c09ce35d7253b7 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\n        Either an rml:object or rml:objectMap must be provided, not multiple\n        " .
_:n7872ec92ee854a3a956147b0c6a5f558b1 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#description> "\r\n        A leaf expression field is an expression field without nested fields.\r\n        " .
