_:n3a500faaf1544722a3c3a02ac57f5b1fb6 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#description> "\n        Inclusion (and ForeignKey) annotations targeting this logical view\n        via rml:targetView. Reached via the inverse of rml:targetView, not\n        rml:structuralAnnotation -- an InclusionAnnotation is the SUBJECT\n        of rml:targetView, not this view's own value, so it isn't\n        otherwise reachable from here; without this property it would\n        never get checked at all.\n        " .
_:n9aab61962ed04d5bbf4148fa8b0e83bab6 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest> _:n9aab61962ed04d5bbf4148fa8b0e83bab7 .
