<http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/StructuralAnnotationShape> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\r\n    Structural annotations provide a mechanism to express relationships between logical views, as well as additional information about fields.\r\n    " .
_:n6946071f32ea40d6971da500c0528e7ab7 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#first> <http://w3id.org/rml/BlankNode> .
