<http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/RMLLogicalViewShape> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#property> _:n3a500faaf1544722a3c3a02ac57f5b1fb6 .
<http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/StructuralAnnotationShape> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\r\n    Node must have a valid rml:StructuralAnnotationShape description.\r\n    All structural annotations of a logical view lv MUST have an on fields property (rml:onFields), linking the structural annotation to a list of field names occurring in lv.\r\n    rml:StructuralAnnotationShape requires:\r\n    - exactly one rml:onFields property.\r\n    " .
_:n3a622d719b4f49eaae64b5a5e779be76b7 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#nodeKind> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#Literal> .
