_:n30b597b1e1434b2ab750bdf06cd7f45bb6 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#nil> .
<http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/RMLSubjectMapShape> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\n    Subject Map must generate a resource representing the subject of\n    an RDF triple.\n    " .
